    '<p class="muted simulator-boundary-note">The same '+esc(String(meta.optionCount || (config.zoneDefinitionOptions || []).length))+' valid definitions apply to Zones 1–128. [<][>] scrolls through only these valid definitions. [*] saves the displayed definition, plays the confirmation beeps, and advances to the next zone. Entering three definition digits shows the matching name immediately; after '+esc(String(meta.directEntryConfirmationMs == null ? 1100 : meta.directEntryConfirmationMs))+' ms the keypad advances and plays the confirmation beeps. An invalid three-digit code restores the original code/name and plays the long beep. [*] saves the displayed definition and, by default, advances to the next zone with the Confirmation sound. [#] always cancels the displayed/scrolled definition without saving and, by default, returns to the first zone that started the current chained editing session with the Cancel sound. Direct-entry completion previews the selected definition for the programmed delay, saves it, then advances with its configured sound/action. Each zone writes through its <code>neo-installer-XXX-zone-N-definition-type</code> relationship.</p>';
