    return '<details class="navigation-settings-card navigation-direct-entry-programming"><summary>Zone Definition chain — keys, sounds, direct entry and return behavior</summary><div class="navigation-settings-card-body"><p class="muted">This is the <strong>live governing configuration</strong> for the Zone Definition selector. A chain starts when a zone is selected from the 001 Zone Definitions zone list. Saving can advance through later zones, while [#] can return to the zone that originally started that chain.</p><div class="navigation-zone-definition-governor-grid"><section class="simulator-option-group"><h5>[*] confirm displayed definition</h5><label>Additional action sound<select data-nav-flow-default="selectSound">'+navigationDesignerSoundOptions(zdfs.selectSound,'Confirmation')+'</select></label>'+navigationDesignerRoutePickerMarkup(zdfs.selectTarget,config,'zoneDefinitionOptions',{},'selectTarget','flow')+'</section><section class="simulator-option-group"><h5>[#] cancel / go back</h5><label>Additional action sound<select data-nav-flow-default="backSound">'+navigationDesignerSoundOptions(zdfs.backSound,'Cancel')+'</select></label>'+navigationDesignerRoutePickerMarkup(zdfs.backTarget,config,'zoneDefinitionOptions',{},'backTarget','flow')+'</section><section class="simulator-option-group"><h5>Valid 3-digit direct entry</h5><label>Additional action sound<select data-nav-flow-default="directEntrySound">'+navigationDesignerSoundOptions(zdfs.directEntrySound,'Selection')+'</select></label>'+navigationDesignerRoutePickerMarkup(zdfs.directEntryTarget,config,'zoneDefinitionOptions',{},'directEntryTarget','flow')+'</section></div><div class="simulator-form-grid navigation-direct-entry-grid"><label>Definition-code length<input readonly value="3 digits"></label><label>Valid-code preview duration (ms)<input data-nav-direct-meta-field="directEntryConfirmationMs" type="number" min="0" max="10000" step="50" value="'+esc(String(zdMs))+'"></label><label>Invalid completed code sound<select data-nav-direct-meta-field="invalidSound">'+navigationDesignerExplicitSoundOptions(String(zdMeta.invalidSound||'long'),true)+'</select></label><label>Chain starts from<input readonly value="The zone selected in the 001 Zone Definitions zone list"></label></div><div class="navigation-direct-entry-example"><strong>Current programmed sequence</strong><span>Chain start → remember the first selected zone'+(startZone?' (currently Zone '+esc(String(startZone))+')':'')+'.</span><span>Digit 1 → replace the first displayed definition digit; cursor moves to digit 2.</span><span>Digit 2 → replace the second digit; cursor moves to digit 3.</span><span>Digit 3 valid → keep <code>Zone N  (XXX) &lt;&gt;</code> with the cursor under the third digit, show the entered definition name for '+esc(String(zdMs))+' ms, then save it and run the configured Direct-entry sound/action.</span><span>Digit 3 invalid → play the configured invalid sound, restore the original code/name, cursor returns to digit 1.</span><span>[*] → save the displayed definition and run the configured [*] sound/action.</span><span>[#] → do not save the currently displayed/scrolled definition; run the configured [#] sound/action. Default programming returns to the <strong>first zone that started the chain</strong>.</span></div></div></details>';
