function saveSnippet(){ var trigger=($('snippetTrigger').value||'').replace(/^\/+/, '').trim().replace(/\s+/g,'-'); var title=($('snippetTitle').value||'').trim(); var body=($('snippetBody').value||''); if(!trigger||!title||!body.trim()){toast('Trigger, title, and body are required.');return;} state.snippets.unshift({id:makeId(),trigger:trigger,title:title,tags:[],body:body}); save('dsc-snippets-v6',state.snippets); renderSnippets(); toast('Snippet saved.'); }
function handleSlash(){ var ta=$('caseNotes'), menu=$('slashMenu'); if(!ta||!menu) return; var before=ta.value.slice(0,ta.selectionStart); var m=before.match(/(^|\s)\/([a-z0-9-_]*)$/i); if(!m){menu.classList.add('hidden');return;} var q=lower(m[2]); var matches=state.snippets.filter(function(s){return !q||s.trigger.indexOf(q)>=0||lower(s.title).indexOf(q)>=0;}).slice(0,8); if(!matches.length){menu.classList.add('hidden');return;} var r=ta.getBoundingClientRect(); menu.style.left=Math.max(12,Math.min(r.left,window.innerWidth-440))+'px'; menu.style.top=Math.max(12,r.top-270)+'px'; menu.innerHTML=matches.map(function(s){return '<button type="button" class="slash-option" data-insert="'+esc(s.id)+'"><strong>/'+esc(s.trigger)+'</strong><br><span class="muted">'+esc(s.title)+'</span></button>';}).join(''); menu.classList.remove('hidden'); qsa('[data-insert]',menu).forEach(function(btn){btn.onclick=function(){insertSnippet(btn.getAttribute('data-insert'));};}); }
